## history
### 2026-10-17 (UTC) — attempt 2: variable tables for the large and sparse records
- baseline created over 31 tables — data written BEFORE this point is not covered by it

### 2026-10-17 (UTC) — attempt 4: the operation record holds its lists, result and timers whole; card texts, queued entries and manifests ride as blobs; the chunk and part tables are retired; no record of the area has been written yet
